      "en": "and not to build houses for ourselves to dwell in. We have no vineyard, field, or seed;",
      "ko": "거처할 집도 짓지 아니하며 포도원이나 밭이나 종자도 두지 아니하고",
      "source_text_hash": "21ea4550c5eb64bb245b6195b7055a2747c0f579f320420f34bb7f48e5ccbaeb",
      "translation_text_hash": "253691151b7a5245125e2e7f5b54c0806f1ada369569419f9a4b718af552c7f0",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
